\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  MAS Briefly  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  To Cushion US Dollar Fall -Source\b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 2010\par 03:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar hit an all-time high against the greenback, a person familiar with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's thinking said.\par \par \uc2 The person said the MAS "briefly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  around S$1.3204" to smooth the U.S. dollar's decline.\par \par \uc2 The Singapore dollar overnight hit a record high, with the U.S. dollar falling to S$1.3192. At 0140 GMT the greenback was trading at S$1.3222.\par \par \uc2 "They (MAS) can't change the trend of the weak dollar against Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  but they will try to make the fall orderly. At this point they will continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around S$1.3200," the person said.\par \par \uc2 It was the second time this month that the MAS has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses the exchange rate rather than interest rates as its main policy tool because Singapore's trade flows dwarf the island's small domestic economy.\par \par \uc2 The MAS aggressively tightened policy in April by raising the trading band for the Singapore dollar and targeting a "modest and gradual appreciation" for the local dollar, changing its previous policy of zero appreciation.\par \par \uc2 -By Singapore Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 65 6415 4150; djn.singapore.bureau@dowjones.com [ 28-09-10 0143GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100928e69s0003g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
